[node name="Title" parent="Interact1/Tab/HBoxContainer" index="1"]
text = "Interacting with Buildings (1)"

[node name="Text" parent="Interact1/Backdrop/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="0"]
text = "Now that you've placed a new 'City' building down, you may notice that you are losing [color=#71c548]Food[/color] [img]res://code/resources/miniResourceIcons/food.tres[/img] per turn. (The lower number to the right of the [color=#71c548]Food[/color] [img]res://code/resources/miniResourceIcons/food.tres[/img] icon in the top right reads -2).

Don't panic! Although it is true that you will lose the game if you run out of food, we can solve this deficit with ease. You may notice that in exchange for consuming your [color=#71c548]Food[/color] [img]res://code/resources/miniResourceIcons/food.tres[/img], the 'City' you placed produces some extra [color=#f00]Labor[/color] [img]res://code/resources/miniResourceIcons/labor.tres[/img]."

[node name="ChoiceTitle" parent="Interact1/Backdrop/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="1"]
text = "Page 12"

[node name="Interact2" parent="." instance=ExtResource("2_lgwr8")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 0.0
offset_top = 211.0
offset_right = 320.0
offset_bottom = 552.0

[node name="Title" parent="Interact2/Tab/HBoxContainer" index="1"]
text = "Interacting with Buildings (2)"

[node name="Text" parent="Interact2/Backdrop/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="0"]
text = "If you aren't there already, navigate the camera to Height 0 (try pressing 'Q'). 

As you can see, you have 3 buildings on Height 0 already generated at the start of the game; aside from the 'Platform' you placed earlier.

Select the 'Farm' building. 
It looks like this: [img]res://code/resources/farmBuilding.tres[/img]
Once you've selected it, press the 'Interact' tab. It's below this page, and also directly right of the 'Build' tab from earlier.
"

[node name="ChoiceTitle" parent="Interact2/Backdrop/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="1"]
text = "Page 13"

[node name="Interact3" parent="." instance=ExtResource("2_lgwr8")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 0.0
offset_top = 199.0
offset_right = 320.0
offset_bottom = 552.0

[node name="Title" parent="Interact3/Tab/HBoxContainer" index="1"]
text = "Interacting with Buildings (3)"

[node name="Text" parent="Interact3/Backdrop/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="0"]
text = "On the 'Interact' menu you can see a[color=#f00] big red 'Labor'[/color] [img]res://code/resources/miniResourceIcons/labor.tres[/img] symbol with two buttons surrounding it.

The number to the left represents the number of 'Workers' currently working on the selected building. Further to the right, you can see the resources this building produces and consumes.

For each worker you add to this 'Farm', you consume 1 [color=#f00]Labor[/color] [img]res://code/resources/miniResourceIcons/labor.tres[/img] per turn. However, the 'Farm' will also produce an additional 2 [color=#71c548]Food[/color] [img]res://code/resources/miniResourceIcons/food.tres[/img] each turn.
Increase the worker count by clicking the button on the right and then continue."

[node name="ChoiceTitle" parent="Interact3/Backdrop/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="1"]
text = "Page 14"

[node name="Next Turn" parent="." instance=ExtResource("2_lgwr8")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 1
offset_left = 896.0
offset_top = 152.0
offset_right = 1152.0
offset_bottom = 440.0

[node name="Title" parent="Next Turn/Tab/HBoxContainer" index="1"]
text = "Ending Your Turn"

[node name="Text" parent="Next Turn/Backdrop/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="0"]
text = "Now that all our affairs are in order, let's progress the game.
When you think you've done all you can for a turn, press the round button with the blue arrow to end your turn. The number in the center indicates what turn you are currently on.

Click the 'Next Turn' button and then click 'Next' on the tutorial."

[node name="ChoiceTitle" parent="Next Turn/Backdrop/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="1"]
text = "Page 15"

[node name="Flooding" parent="." instance=ExtResource("2_lgwr8")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 1
offset_left = 0.0
offset_top = 96.0
offset_right = 320.0
offset_bottom = 431.0

[node name="Title" parent="Flooding/Tab/HBoxContainer" index="1"]
text = "Flooding"

[node name="Text" parent="Flooding/Backdrop/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="0"]
text = "Now, meet your enemy: the Great Flood.
'Flood Progress' indicates how close the next height is to being completely overrun by floodwaters. You can also view how much the flood will progress in the next turn.
Far to the end of this bar is a label reading 'Height __', which indicates what height the flood is currently progressing on.
At the start of the game, you receive a 5-turn 'grace period' wherein no flood progress will be made.
When the flood claims your last city, you lose the game."

[node name="ChoiceTitle" parent="Flooding/Backdrop/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="1"]
text = "Page 16"

[node name="Events" parent="." instance=ExtResource("2_lgwr8")]
visible = false
